    "description": {
      "values": [
        {
          "locale": "en-US",
          "value": "A half zip earns its place by giving you two garments. Zipped to the top the funnel collar covers the neck properly; halfway down it opens into something closer to a crew. Dropped shoulders keep the line soft, and ribbed cuffs and hem stop the relaxed cut from turning shapeless. Sizes 8 to 22, machine washable."
        },
        {
          "locale": "en-GB",
          "value": "A half zip earns its place by giving you two garments. Zipped to the top the funnel collar covers the neck properly; halfway down it opens into something closer to a crew. Dropped shoulders keep the line soft, and ribbed cuffs and hem stop the relaxed cut from turning shapeless. Sizes 8 to 22, machine washable."
        },
        {
          "locale": "es-ES",
          "value": "Una media cremallera se gana su sitio porque te da dos prendas. Subida del todo, el cuello chimenea cubre bien el cuello; a medio camino se abre en algo más parecido a un cuello redondo. Los hombros caídos suavizan la línea, y los puños y el bajo de canalé evitan que el corte holgado pierda la forma. Tallas de la 8 a la 22, lavable a máquina."
        },
        {
          "locale": "fr-FR",
          "value": "Un demi-zip mérite sa place parce qu'il vaut deux vêtements. Fermé jusqu'en haut, le col cheminée couvre bien le cou ; à mi-hauteur, il s'ouvre sur quelque chose de plus proche d'un col rond. Les épaules tombantes adoucissent la ligne, et les poignets et le bas côtelés empêchent la coupe ample de devenir informe. Tailles 8 à 22, lavable en machine."
        },
        {
          "locale": "de-DE",
          "value": "Ein Half-Zip verdient sich seinen Platz, weil er zwei Kleidungsstücke in einem ist. Ganz zugezogen bedeckt der Stehkragen den Hals richtig; halb geöffnet wird daraus fast ein Rundhals. Überschnittene Schultern halten die Linie weich, und Rippbündchen an Ärmeln und Saum verhindern, dass der lockere Schnitt formlos wird. Größen 8 bis 22, maschinenwaschbar."
        },
        {
          "locale": "it-IT",
          "value": "Una mezza zip si guadagna il posto perché vale due capi. Chiusa fino in cima, il collo a imbuto copre bene il collo; a metà si apre in qualcosa di più vicino a un girocollo. Le spalle scese ammorbidiscono la linea, e polsini e fondo a costine impediscono al taglio comodo di perdere forma. Taglie dalla 8 alla 22, lavabile in lavatrice."
        }
      ],
      "_meta": {
        "schema": "http://bigcontent.io/cms/schema/v1/core#/definitions/localized-value"
      }
